IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `roc-core`
IMPORT `roc5-o21-assessment`
IMPORT `roc5-o21-general`

-- TESTS for roc5-o21-general.l4 (Order 21, rules 1 to 9 and 11 to 16).  Every expected value is written from the
-- text of the Rules (lines 2908 to 3034 of the raw file), beside the assertion, before the module was run.
-- A "last day" below is a made-up answer of O 3 r 3 (seam S-T1).

§ `Tests -- Order 21, Division 1`

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§§ `Rule 1 -- definitions`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- (1): contentious business (Legal Profession Act s 2(1), an input), or written law provides, or the parties consent.
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(1) this Order applies to the costs` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(1) this Order applies to the costs` (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(1) this Order applies to the costs` (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(1) this Order applies to the costs` (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(1) this Order applies to the costs` NOTHING FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(1) this Order applies to the costs` NOTHING TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (2) definitions.
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(2) costs are assessed costs` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(2) costs are assessed costs` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(2) the business is contentious business` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(2) the business is contentious business` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(2) the business is contentious business` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- "costs includes fees, charges, disbursements, expenses and remuneration": the list is open.
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(2) a charge is within costs` `o 21 r 1(2) a fee` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(2) a charge is within costs` `o 21 r 1(2) a disbursement` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(2) a charge is within costs` `o 21 r 1(2) remuneration` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(2) a charge is within costs` `o 21 r 1(2) another kind of charge` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(2) the basis is the indemnity basis` `o 21 r 22(3) the indemnity basis` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(2) the basis is the indemnity basis` `o 21 r 22(2) the standard basis` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(2) the basis is the standard basis` `o 21 r 22(2) the standard basis` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(2) the basis is the standard basis` `o 21 r 22(3) the indemnity basis` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (3): "include" on a fund.
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(3)(a) a reference to a fund includes a reference to the thing` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(3)(a) a reference to a fund includes a reference to the thing` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(3)(a) a reference to a fund includes a reference to the thing` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(3)(b) a reference to a fund held by a trustee or personal representative includes a reference to the thing` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(3)(b) a reference to a fund held by a trustee or personal representative includes a reference to the thing` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 r 1(3)(b) a reference to a fund held by a trustee or personal representative includes a reference to the thing` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§§ `Rule 2 -- powers of the Court`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(1) costs are in the discretion of the Court` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(1) costs are in the discretion of the Court` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2): listed circumstances must be had regard to; another circumstance only if relevant.
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(2) the Court must have regard to the circumstance` `o 21 r 2(2)(a) efforts made by the parties at amicable resolution` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(2) the Court must have regard to the circumstance` `o 21 r 2(2)(g) the principle of proportionality` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(2) the Court must have regard to the circumstance` `o 21 r 2(2)(h) the stage at which the proceedings were concluded` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(2) the Court must have regard to the circumstance` `o 21 r 2(2)(a) efforts made by the parties at amicable resolution` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(2) the Court must have regard to the circumstance` `o 21 r 2(2) another circumstance` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(2) the Court must have regard to the circumstance` `o 21 r 2(2) another circumstance` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (3): fixed by the Court which heard the matter, unless it directs an assessment.
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(3) the costs must be fixed by the Court which heard the matter` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(3) the costs must be fixed by the Court which heard the matter` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(3) the costs must be fixed by the Court which heard the matter` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(3) the Court heard the parties before it fixed the costs` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(3) the Court heard the parties before it fixed the costs` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(3) the Court heard the parties before it fixed the costs` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (4): payable from the date of the order unless the parties agree otherwise.
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(4) the costs are payable from the date of the Court's order` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(4) the costs are payable from the date of the Court's order` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(4) the date from which the costs are payable` (Date 1 2 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST (Date 1 2 2027)
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(4) the date from which the costs are payable` (Date 1 2 2027) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (5) to (8).
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(5) the Court may order the parties' costs to be set off against one another` 2 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(5) the Court may order the parties' costs to be set off against one another` 3 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(5) the Court may order the parties' costs to be set off against one another` 1 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(6) the Court may stay or dismiss the application, action or appeal or make any other order` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(6) the Court may stay or dismiss the application, action or appeal or make any other order` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(6) the Court may stay or dismiss the application, action or appeal or make any other order` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(7) the Court hearing the appeal may deal with the costs of the proceedings giving rise to the appeal and of the appeal` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(7) the Court hearing the appeal may deal with the costs of the proceedings giving rise to the appeal and of the appeal` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(8) the General Division may decide the costs of the whole proceedings or direct the other court to decide the costs before the transfer` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 2(8) the General Division may decide the costs of the whole proceedings or direct the other court to decide the costs before the transfer` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§§ `Rule 3 -- entitlement to costs`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- (1): no entitlement except under an order of the Court (or a later provision of the Order).
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(1) a party is entitled to recover costs from another party` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(1) a party is entitled to recover costs from another party` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(1) a party is entitled to recover costs from another party` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2): the successful party, unless some other order should be made.
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(2) the Court must order the costs in favour of the successful party` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(2) the Court must order the costs in favour of the successful party` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(2) the Court must order the costs in favour of the successful party` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (3), (4).
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(3) the party making the amendment bears the costs of and occasioned by it` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(3) the party making the amendment bears the costs of and occasioned by it` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(3) the party making the amendment bears the costs of and occasioned by it` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(3) the party making the amendment bears the costs of and occasioned by it` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(4) the party making the application bears the costs of and occasioned by it` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(4) the party making the application bears the costs of and occasioned by it` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(4) the party making the application bears the costs of and occasioned by it` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (5): trustee, personal representative or mortgagee.
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(5) the person is entitled to the costs out of the fund or the mortgaged property` `o 21 r 3(5) trustee` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(5) the person is entitled to the costs out of the fund or the mortgaged property` `o 21 r 3(5) personal representative` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(5) the person is entitled to the costs out of the fund or the mortgaged property` `o 21 r 3(5) mortgagee` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(5) the person is entitled to the costs out of the fund or the mortgaged property` `o 21 r 3(5) another capacity` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(5) the person is entitled to the costs out of the fund or the mortgaged property` `o 21 r 3(5) trustee` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(5) the costs not recovered from or paid by any other person` 1000 400 EQUALS 600
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(5) the costs not recovered from or paid by any other person` 1000 1000 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `o 21 r 3(5) the costs not recovered from or paid by any other person` 1000 1500 EQUALS 0

